            {
              "lessonId": "recBxlAxCj4Hcho8L",
              "termNumber": 1,
              "termLabel": "Term 1",
              "weekNumber": 5,
              "weekLabel": "Week 5",
              "sequence": 5,
              "lessonLabel": "Lesson 5",
              "linkLabel": "Lit./Mythology",
              "title": "30m Lit./Mythology: Grades 7-8 - Lesson 5",
              "body": "⍞ Materials: Lightning Dreamer\n\n➜ RECAP \nWhat do you remember about the orphan theater? \n\n➜ READ, NARRATE, & DISCUSS\np.56-70\n\n• What was Manuel's concern in this chapter? Is it for Tula? Or himself? \n• How does reading about injustice differ from actually experiencing it for Tula?",
              "teacherNotes": "",
              "editUrl": "https://airtable.com/apphTWdjAdJEcAmoe/pago27hsdn3q8TtGK?XRKkD=recrSWSoC0yNwPHrT&6J82c=recBxlAxCj4Hcho8L",
              "lessonLinksUrl": "",
              "links": []
