            {
              "lessonId": "recuuAxb1NAk8RPxC",
              "termNumber": 1,
              "termLabel": "Term 1",
              "weekNumber": 10,
              "weekLabel": "Week 10",
              "sequence": 10,
              "lessonLabel": "Lesson 10",
              "linkLabel": "Lit./Mythology",
              "title": "30m Lit./Mythology: Grades 7-8 - Lesson 10",
              "body": "⍞ Materials: Lightning Dreamer\n\n➜ RECAP \nWhat do you remember of Sab's story? \n\n➜ READ, NARRATE, & DISCUSS\np.145-159\n\n• Why do you think Tula finally reads her verses in public? \n• What do you think will happen after Manuel tells Tula what Mama has planned?",
              "teacherNotes": "",
              "editUrl": "https://airtable.com/apphTWdjAdJEcAmoe/pago27hsdn3q8TtGK?XRKkD=recrSWSoC0yNwPHrT&6J82c=recuuAxb1NAk8RPxC",
