            {
              "lessonId": "recrVTALFJifYaSU5",
              "termNumber": 1,
              "termLabel": "Term 1",
              "weekNumber": 11,
              "weekLabel": "Week 11",
              "sequence": 11,
              "lessonLabel": "Lesson 11",
              "linkLabel": "Lit./Mythology",
              "title": "30m Lit./Mythology: Grades 7-8 - Lesson 11",
              "body": "⍞ Materials: Lightning Dreamer\n\n➜ RECAP \nWhat happened when Tula went to the city to live? \n\n➜ READ, NARRATE, & DISCUSS\np.160-167 & p.175-179\n\n• We are told why Tula is fleeing to Spain. Why do you think Manuel is joining her? Does this contradict Tula's thoughts that men are freer that women? \n• What has Tula learned about love during the book?",
              "teacherNotes": "",
              "editUrl": "https://airtable.com/apphTWdjAdJEcAmoe/pago27hsdn3q8TtGK?XRKkD=recrSWSoC0yNwPHrT&6J82c=recrVTALFJifYaSU5",
