    {
      "type": "exams",
      "title": "Lit./Mythology: Grades 7-8",
      "hasExams": true,
      "terms": [
        {
          "term": "Term 1",
          "content": "· Tula defies nearly every expectation placed on her. What does the novel suggest it truly costs to live an authentic life, and is that cost worth it?\n\n· Tula believes that poetry can change the world. By the end of the novel, do you think she has been proven right? Use moments from the story to support your position."
        },
        {
          "term": "Term 2",
          "content": "· Explain how Scrooge changes from the beginning to the end of A Christmas Carol. What helps him change the most? Use examples from the story."
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
